1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,255
Sclerenchyma is dead mechanical tissue.

2
00:00:03,255 --> 00:00:08,268
The wall is thick, evenly lignified and pierced by simple pits.

3
00:00:08,268 --> 00:00:13,880
The lumen inside is tiny, and the living contents disappear at maturity.

4
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:17,369
It gives rigidity, hardness and strength.

